      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 54: 🟡 `photo()` uses `it.key().contains(Property::PHOTO)`, which is a case-sensitive substring match. vCard property names are case-insensitive, and substring matching can also select unrelated keys that merely contain `PHOTO`. Parse the property name token (before `;`/`:`) and compare it to `PHOTO` with case-insensitive equality to avoid false negatives and false positives.",
